      <section id="costs" class="pillar-section" aria-labelledby="h2-costs">
        <h2 id="h2-costs" class="pillar-h2">What Medicare Costs in 2026: The Numbers You Need Before You Enroll</h2>

        <p>
          Understanding the exact 2026 cost figures before you enroll helps you choose the right coverage path. These numbers come from the <a href="https://www.cms.gov/newsroom/fact-sheets/2025-medicare-parts-b-premiums-deductibles" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CMS 2026 Medicare Parts A and B Premiums and Deductibles Fact Sheet</a>.
